+## Before real import
+
+Run pure synthetic tests first. After separate authorization, use a disposable DB with migrations verified and synthetic seeded data, never the currently configured database. Exercise fail-closed preview/apply, same-input replay, partial snapshot, source withdrawal, existing ACCEPT/REJECT and externally seeded REVOKED state, all transaction rollback branches, and concurrent author/identity races. Verify API/frontend source/candidate/approved/conflict labels and global versus personal count scopes. Compare normalized row identities and immutable evidence, not only row totals or SQL DISTINCT.
+
+For 410/83/69 eventual acceptance: stage all source profiles/claims first; require zero silently dropped records, explicit unresolved/collision reports, no auto canonical decisions, an import hash manifest and backup/recovery procedure. Complete source-only IDs and no-candidate cases must remain inspectable. This gate does not authorize running that acceptance import.
